{"id":"a72f024d8daeb569","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-substitution.md","title":"Capture-Avoiding Substitution","display":"df-substitution — Capture-Avoiding Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-substitution","aliases":["88-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — Capture-Avoiding Substitution","depends_on":["[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","[[88-df-function]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — Capture-Avoiding Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9df3c26c280af75a\" href=\"?note=9df3c26c280af75a\" title=\"88-df-atomic-formula\">88-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,u,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variables, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> (relation symbol)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S\\)</span> (variable maps, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> (free-for-substitution predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[u/x]\">\\(t[u/x]\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[u/x]\">\\(\\varphi[u/x]\\)</span> (term and formula substitution operations)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubFml}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S\\)</span> 是下述递归方程所确定的函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[u/x]\">\\(t[u/x]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[u/x]\">\\(\\varphi[u/x]\\)</span> 分别是它们在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t,u,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle t,u,x\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle\\)</span> 的值。公式代入只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> 成立时有定义，不隐含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>函数图及部分函数谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a> 的三元部分函数图谓词；公式代入图的输入域和输出域取下述相应公式集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S,\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S,\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S:\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S,\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S,\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S:\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;x[u/x]=u\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(y\\neq x\\to y[u/x]=y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c[u/x]=c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nf(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nf(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;x[u/x]=u\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(y\\neq x\\to y[u/x]=y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c[u/x]=c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nf(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nf(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\land\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\psi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\ny=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}{}\\lor\n(y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\land\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\psi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\ny=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}{}\\lor\n(y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(t_1=t_2)[u/x]=\\bigl(t_1[u/x]=t_2[u/x]\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(t_1=t_2)[u/x]=\\bigl(t_1[u/x]=t_2[u/x]\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\nP(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nP(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\nP(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nP(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\to(\\neg\\varphi)[u/x]=\\neg(\\varphi[u/x])\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\to(\\neg\\varphi)[u/x]=\\neg(\\varphi[u/x])\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\to(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[u/x]=\n\\varphi[u/x]\\land\\psi[u/x]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\to(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[u/x]=\n\\varphi[u/x]\\land\\psi[u/x]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\to\n(\\forall y\\,\\varphi)[u/x]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\,\\varphi,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall y\\,(\\varphi[u/x]),&amp;y\\neq x\\land x\\in\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\n\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u).\n\\end{cases}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\to\n(\\forall y\\,\\varphi)[u/x]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\,\\varphi,&amp;y=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall y\\,(\\varphi[u/x]),&amp;y\\neq x\\land x\\in\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\n\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u).\n\\end{cases}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\)</span>恰好排除把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>中的自由变量置于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>既有量词之下的捕获情形。</li>\n<li>本原子采用“先检查可代入性”的部分操作版本；若需要对任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,\\varphi\">\\(u,\\varphi\\)</span>\n给出总操作，可先作确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名，再应用这里的递归等式。</li>\n<li>闭项（尤其数词与 Henkin 常量）不含变量，因而总可自由代入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-