Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)$ 使用 [[88-df-partial-function]] 的三元部分函数图谓词；公式代入图的输入域和输出域取下述相应公式集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t,u,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"t[u/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[u/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t[u/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[u/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t,u,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{SubTerm}_S,\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S,\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S),\\\\\n&\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{SubFml}_S)=\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,u,x\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S\\times\\mathrm{Var}_S:\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&x[u/x]=u\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(y\\neq x\\to y[u/x]=y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c[u/x]=c)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\nf(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nf(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\theta)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\land\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\psi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\ny=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}{}\\lor\n(y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\n(t_1=t_2)[u/x]=\\bigl(t_1[u/x]=t_2[u/x]\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\nP(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)[u/x]=\nP(t_1[u/x],\\ldots,t_n[u/x])","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\to(\\neg\\varphi)[u/x]=\\neg(\\varphi[u/x])\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\to(\\varphi\\land\\psi)[u/x]=\n\\varphi[u/x]\\land\\psi[u/x]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\forall y\\,\\varphi)\n\\to\n(\\forall y\\,\\varphi)[u/x]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\,\\varphi,&y=x\\lor x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall y\\,(\\varphi[u/x]),&y\\neq x\\land x\\in\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\n\\land y\\notin\\mathrm{var}_S(u).\n\\end{cases}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"u,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":4961,"backlinks":[{"id":"19f597e8b5469bbc","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0aa80b611d62ec1b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{free}_S$ 与 $\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S$ 见 [[88-df-free-variable]]、[[88-df-substitution]]；仅在可自由代入时使用 $\\varphi[t/x]$。"},{"id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"75bb18f474452a05","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\phi[y/x],\\phi[z/x]$ 是 [[88-df-substitution]] 的自由代入；上述新鲜性保证其 $\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L$ 条件。$c_0\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 见 [[88-df-term]]。"},{"id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pr(v)$ 记固定公式 $\\Pr$，$\\Pr(t)$ 缩写 $\\Pr[t/v]$；$\\pi(u,v)$ 记固定公式 $\\pi$。这些是句法公式及其 [[88-df-substitution]] 代入，不是数值函数。$\\mathrm